      "key": "t0120fbbf667f6799",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex trading involves buying and selling currency pairs based on changes in exchange rates. Although the market operates online, the company providing access to trading can significantly influence the overall <span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">trading experience</span>.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
