        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外匯交易是根據匯率變化買賣貨幣對。雖然市場在線上運作，提供交易服務的公司仍可能顯著影響整體<span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">交易體驗</span>。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t09c1819910ffb85b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is why comparing forex brokers in Abu Dhabi requires more than looking at promotional offers. Traders should understand exactly what services a company provides, which legal entity handles their account and what protections apply.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/not-sure-which-forex-broker-to-trust-important-factors-abu-dhabi-traders-should-check-first"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">這就是為什麼比較阿布扎比的外匯經紀商需要的不僅僅是檢視促銷優惠。交易者應準確瞭解公司提供哪些服務、哪個法人實體處理其賬戶以及適用哪些保護措施。</span>"
    },
