      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Abu Dhabi has a diverse population of professionals, business owners and individuals interested in international financial markets. Online <span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">trading platforms</span> have made it easier to explore currency markets without visiting a physical brokerage office.</span>",
